    Merges multiple word frequency dictionaries and returns a sorted list of tuples
    containing words and their frequencies.

    :param dict_list: List of dictionaries, each containing word frequency data.
    :return: List of tuples (word, frequency) sorted by frequency (descending) and lexicographically.
